<title>HONG KONG: C.Lyonnais sets call warrants on H-shares basket.</title>
<headline>C.Lyonnais sets call warrants on H-shares basket.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Lyonnais Financial Products (Guernsey) Ltd said on Thursday it launched one billion American-style call warrants on a basket of nine locally listed Chinese enterprises' H-shares.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises:</p>
<p> Anhui Expressway Co Ltd			  0.2 shares</p>
<p> Guangdong Kelon Electrical Holdings Co Ltd 0.08 shares</p>
<p> Guangshen Railway Co Ltd			 0.1 shares</p>
<p> Jilin Chemical Industrial Co Ltd	     0.4 shares</p>
<p> Maanshan Iron and Steel Co Ltd		 0.2 shares</p>
<p> Shanghai Haixing Shipping Co Ltd	    0.4 shares</p>
<p> Shanghai Petrochemical Co Ltd		 0.1 shares</p>
<p> Tsingtao Brewery Co Ltd			 0.1 shares</p>
<p> Yizheng Chemical Fibre Co Ltd		 0.2 shares</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one basket.  STRIKE PRICE	HK$3.469	 PREMIUM	 31 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.1075	GEARING	 3.25x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  02.APR.98	PAYDATE	 20.JAN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG	LISTING DATE  22.JAN.97</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT    HK$3.469	 EXER LOT	10,000</p>
<p> GOVERNING LAW     HONG KONG</p>
<p>NOTE: CASH SETTLEMENT OR PHYSICAL DELIVERY AT THE DISCRETION OF ISSUER.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
